#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:5 58776885cad24ba884268b17c2983b44
msgid "🚀 Getting Started"
msgstr "🚀 入门指南"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:7 a644c5c7091445449c6fceb1f3d68c5f
msgid "This guide will walk you through setting up a local development environment to build, test, and contribute to our modules."
msgstr "本指南将带你配置本地开发环境，用于构建、测试并为我们的模块做出贡献。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:11 2fb47e2fe43f4667b1dec1f287f66813
msgid "⚙️ Prerequisites"
msgstr "⚙️ 准备工作"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:13 21b117cba5204d4b88e6bf64283f60f2
msgid "Before you start, make sure your system is ready by completing the following steps:"
msgstr "开始前，请完成以下步骤，确保系统环境就绪："

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:15 f4cc14bdece24b83bcdce88490e042b6
msgid "**Install [UV](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)**, a Python package and project manager."
msgstr "**安装 [UV](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)**，它是 Python 包和项目管理器。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:16 d38c989da7ea413984feac69b9d16b71
msgid "**Clone the repository**, if you haven’t done this before, follow this step-by-step tutorial: [First Contributions Guide](https://github.com/firstcontributions/first-contributions/blob/main/README.md). Once cloned, open the project folder in your preferred code editor."
msgstr "**克隆仓库**。如果你还没有完成这一步，请参阅分步教程：[首次贡献指南](https://github.com/firstcontributions/first-contributions/blob/main/README.md)。克隆完成后，用你喜欢的代码编辑器打开项目文件夹。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:20 5b546bc1a035475ea26d44dc1198d9e7
msgid "🔨 Building Modules"
msgstr "🔨 构建模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:22 e486d911373f42fb89d4acbf764bc089
msgid "The `modules` directory contains the source files for all modules. Use the following commands to manage and build them efficiently:"
msgstr "`modules` 目录包含所有模块的源文件。使用以下命令管理和高效构建模块："

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:25 1ac024ff591f426ca69830487575169d
msgid "`uv run modules build`"
msgstr "`uv run modules build`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:26 1b9905f73a484642877685c91266b8c1
msgid "Build all modules"
msgstr "构建所有模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:27 3a08af8b6fac4dbfb06b59268173ed14
msgid "`uv run modules watch`"
msgstr "`uv run modules watch`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:28 2a966efc0ce54ff084f3f1822c6c30aa
msgid "Monitor changes and rebuild modules automatically"
msgstr "监视变更并自动重新构建模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:29 fdad7f4b690848f4b2adbf0db74c8147
msgid "`uv run modules <build|watch> <module1> ...`"
msgstr "`uv run modules <build|watch> <module1> ...`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:30 7b13dc7e65d14896ad9f704cc350f5c9
msgid "Build or watch only the specified modules"
msgstr "仅构建或监视指定模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:31 3f494c77e20943b699d691cfe41e9a86
msgid "`uv run link [world]`"
msgstr "`uv run link [world]`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:32 948f29bcf28247f9b944f916a24ba65e
msgid "Link the generated resource and data packs to a Minecraft world"
msgstr "将生成的资源包和数据包连接到 Minecraft 世界"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:35 bdad1f46d9324043911ee82294f07857
msgid "Watching Modules"
msgstr "鐩戞帶妯″潡"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:38 694ec5eb4cd945b5ac62805311a7b4f4
msgid "Building modules can take some time. For a smoother experience, it's recommended to only watch the module you're currently working on: `uv run modules watch <module>`."
msgstr "构建模块可能需要一些时间。为获得更流畅的体验，建议只监视当前正在处理的模块：`uv run modules watch <module>`。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:41 33ef0477646d4795aab416d831880bfa
msgid "Linking Modules to Minecraft"
msgstr "将模块连接到 Minecraft"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:43 239c83811ee14eae9a121db69e730a94
msgid "The `link` command allows you to integrate generated packs directly into a Minecraft world. Below are the options available for this command:"
msgstr "`link` 命令可以将生成的包直接集成到 Minecraft 世界中。该命令可用的选项如下："

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:46 c7e4ace2bd754e26adff08b2696bcf4e
msgid "`world (optional)`"
msgstr "`world（可选）`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:47 0e09c55c424941659386e55a8e457ac6
msgid "The name of the Minecraft world to link"
msgstr "要连接的 Minecraft 世界名称"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:48 97ba3177ac4d48a5b5935322e2d25b8a
msgid "`--minecraft <DIRECTORY>`"
msgstr "`--minecraft <DIRECTORY>`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:49 b29dfa6a96ee44bcb605942b1f57846e
msgid "Path to the `.minecraft` directory (location of Minecraft files)"
msgstr "`.minecraft` 目录的路径（Minecraft 文件所在位置）"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:50 b321cec58a8e49c693c4107c58b47f37
msgid "`--data-pack <DIRECTORY>`"
msgstr "`--data-pack <DIRECTORY>`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:51 ed34967934ec40afa8e1362b9e506447
msgid "Path to the directory where data packs are stored"
msgstr "存放数据包的目录路径"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:52 80afca4c9ebc44e5acb86e077a98dba9
msgid "`--resource-pack <DIRECTORY>`"
msgstr "`--resource-pack <DIRECTORY>`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:53 575c8890db0c4ed2bbed3159b23745ea
msgid "Path to the directory where resource packs are stored"
msgstr "存放资源包的目录路径"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:56 9becb4de7ad245d4824ca1ab32a06c6e
msgid "This workflow demonstrates how to link and continuously test your modules directly in Minecraft:"
msgstr "下面的工作流演示如何在 Minecraft 中直接连接并持续测试模块："

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:67 4397bc97af1e471483562b8a31647dce
msgid "🧪 Testing Modules"
msgstr "🧪 测试模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:69 b53af5ed57124c298472a5e44043d1bc
msgid "Testing is a fundamental aspect of software development. It helps ensure the correctness of your code and can save you from potential bugs in the future."
msgstr "测试是软件开发的重要环节，有助于确保代码正确，并避免未来出现潜在问题。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:71 d2888ecaf1c1439b905e94469b1180ab
msgid "To learn how to write and run tests for your modules, refer to the [Debug Section](project:debug-tools.md#-unit-tests)."
msgstr "如需了解如何为模块编写和运行测试，请参阅[调试章节](project:debug-tools.md#-unit-tests)。"

